.TH GEMINI-MCP-REGISTER 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
gemini-mcp-register \- Register zdots MCP servers with Gemini CLI at user scope.
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBgemini-mcp-register --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: gemini-mcp-register [--force]

Register zdots MCP servers with Gemini CLI at user scope.

Servers registered:
  ctx    ctx-mcp — knowledge base (lessons, methodologies, session residue)
  llama  llama-mcp — llama.cpp inference stack management

Safe to run multiple times — exits 0 without changes if already registered.
Use --force to overwrite existing registrations (updates command path / env).

Options:
  --force   Re-register even if already present

After registration, restart your Gemini CLI session.
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
